          "uuid": "0354565a-846f-5095-a081-1286c1f7e6b5",
          "weight": "10.0"
        },
        {
          "comments": "NOT REVIEWED — raw running config supplied for manual review; no automated pass, finding, or applicability decision asserted.",
          "finding_details": "Raw running config SHA-256: aee75ec93771eedc6391a141a5fbdc3613409dcba611e39db2e0be67f47b8953\nOfficial Cisco benchmark SHA-256: b61d3acf092c40bed15b5ef81c69c66c49476a70de4a4d530cf582aed2fb7356\nRunning config alone does not verify this control's complete operational check; manual review required.",
          "fix_text": "This requirement is not applicable for the DODIN Backbone.\n\nDisable CDP on all external interfaces via no cdp command or disable CDP globally via no cdp command.",
          "group_id": "V-216765",
          "group_id_src": "V-216765",
          "group_title": "SRG-NET-000364-RTR-000111",
          "rule_id": "SV-216765r856443_rule",
          "rule_id_src": "SV-216765r856443_rule",
          "rule_title": "The Cisco perimeter router must be configured to have Cisco Discovery Protocol (CDP) disabled on all external interfaces.",
