          "fix_text": "Configure uRPF loose mode on all CE-facing interfaces as shown in the example\n\nRP/0/0/CPU0:R3(config)#int g1/1/0/0\nRP/0/0/CPU0:R3(config-if)#ipv4 verify unicast source reachable-via any",
