          "finding_details": "Raw running config SHA-256: aee75ec93771eedc6391a141a5fbdc3613409dcba611e39db2e0be67f47b8953\nOfficial Cisco benchmark SHA-256: b61d3acf092c40bed15b5ef81c69c66c49476a70de4a4d530cf582aed2fb7356\nRunning config alone does not verify this control's complete operational check; manual review required.",
